 ring Thanksgiving week. The semester costs $252 for museum members and $2
 80 for non-members\, and ends with an artwork showcase for families. Scho
 larships are available\, though the application deadline for this session
  has passed.\nPrice: from $280\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes: Thursdays · 3:30
